Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:56:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] dt-bindings: iio: light: tsl2583: Add the Apple sensor
 placement

An Apple LSCI calibration can hold one record per light sensor of a
board: the iPad Air 2 has two CT819s, and its record set two records.
Each record names the placement and orientation it was taken for, and
iOS gives each sensor the record that matches the IOHIDPlacementType
and IOHIDOrientationType of its device-tree node (1 and 1 when the node
has none).

Describe those two values as apple,als-placement and
apple,als-orientation, with iOS's default of 1.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../bindings/iio/light/tsl2583.yaml           | 31 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 31 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/tsl2583.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/tsl2583.yaml
index ca79997..1e52758 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/tsl2583.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/light/tsl2583.yaml
@@ -47,6 +47,22 @@ properties:
       the ADT alsCalibration property as resolved by iBoot. Used instead of
       nvmem-cells when present.
 
+  apple,als-placement:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    default: 1
+    description:
+      Where the sensor sits, the ADT's IOHIDPlacementType. An LSCI record set
+      can hold one record per sensor of a board; each record names the
+      placement and orientation it was taken for, and the sensor uses the
+      record that matches its own.
+
+  apple,als-orientation:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    default: 1
+    description:
+      The sensor's orientation, the ADT's IOHIDOrientationType. See
+      apple,als-placement.
+
   nvmem-cells:
     description:
       Apple factory LSCI ambient-light calibration data. Boot firmware must
@@ -79,6 +95,8 @@ allOf:
     else:
       properties:
         apple,als-calibration: false
+        apple,als-orientation: false
+        apple,als-placement: false
         nvmem-cells: false
         nvmem-cell-names: false
 
@@ -102,6 +120,19 @@ examples:
         #address-cells = <1>;
         #size-cells = <0>;
 
+        /* The iPad Air 2: one LSCI record set, a record per sensor */
+        light-sensor@49 {
+            compatible = "apple,ct819", "amstaos,tsl2581";
+            reg = <0x49>;
+            apple,als-placement = <1>;
+            apple,als-orientation = <6>;
+        };
+    };
+  - |
+    i2c {
+        #address-cells = <1>;
+        #size-cells = <0>;
+
         light-sensor@39 {
             compatible = "apple,ct819", "amstaos,tsl2581";
             reg = <0x39>;
